Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:04.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那迟早会是麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, that's gonna be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下昨晚抓来一个离家出走的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men brought in a runaway last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无礼貌可言 我救了她都不知道谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got zero manners, didn't even thank me for saving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些吸血鬼绑架了你 他们是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those vampires stole you. They're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们其他人发现你走了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think when the rest of them find out that you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会自认倒霉 不去多想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they're just gonna shrug and cut their losses?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你家人吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This your family? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they die?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想好要拿她怎么办吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 我做过一些坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, I-I've done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你需要 我就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯姆警长在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is sheriff Hanscum around?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 她这周后面几天都不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. She's out for the rest of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经减掉十磅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already lost 10 pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In… in one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫道格去年离开我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband, Doug, left me last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格就是个混球 你值得更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug's a dick. You deserve better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:50.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:55.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明尼苏达 希宾）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能撑过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:05.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到明尼苏达 达科他 警长度假村）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,19\N{\fnArial\fs30}19.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吃顿饱饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:02:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯警长 苏福尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Jody Mills, Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唐娜·汉斯姆警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sheriff Donna Hanscum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在寂水工作 但我是本地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work out of Stillwater, but I grew up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有什么疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you have any questions…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如哪家汉堡最好 油价最低\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, best burgers, cheapest gas…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把微笑落在苏福尔斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left your smile back in Sioux Falls?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left a kid back in Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一堆工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus a pile of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然镇长坚持让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when the mayor insists you go…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就没得选 可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go, yeah. I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃个棒棒糖吧 - 不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a sucker. - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真漂亮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you looking good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我减了6磅呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost 6 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经成功四分之一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 1/4 of the way there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,能多给我几张饭票吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you could toss me a couple extra meal vouchers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你也不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, since you won't be using them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总这么忠实 唐娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are true blue as ever, Donna, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格是我前夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug and I used to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢一大早上闻羊皮纸的味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I love the smell of parchment in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩多少传说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how much lore is even left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全查不到血印的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got nothing on the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,按理说这群书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think these eggheads,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年囤积了这么多破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the crap they amassed over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中至少该有点真正重要的东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have actually collected something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,公狼/母狼 狼人变性的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He-wolf/she-wolf: a study in werewolf transgenderism."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,600页才第一卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}600 pages, volume 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是真正重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, not something important, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如人类历史上最古老的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… maybe the oldest symbol known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不值得研究一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not worth our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not weird enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰 请大家都就座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, excuse me. If I could get you all seated, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.87,0:05:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是伦·丘斯警长 来自希宾警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, sheriff Len Cuse, uh, Hibbing P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我想说 很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to say first off, uh, what an honor it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年能在希宾招待大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have you all here in Hibbing this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sorry, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-seeing as how this is, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是第一次主持这种事 - 一看就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- my first time hosting one of these things, - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做些新的尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd like to try something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,结伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一位工作地跟你相距\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, f-find… find an officer from 50 miles outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,50英里的警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}of where you hail from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,组成本周末的队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be a team this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家交交朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, uh, a-and make a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯 你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, I know you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全可以在我不在期间做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are totally capable of not throwing a kegger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不办啤酒聚会 完全没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I'm gone… totally, totally capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的信心也令我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My faith in you astounds me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你没有队友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you didn't get a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明尼苏达 达科他警长度假村 活动安排）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文 - 唐娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Kevin. - Hey, Donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what did we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察对冰雪 大雪下不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cops VS. Winter: The Snow Must Go On."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,组建警犬队 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Establishing a k-9 unit." Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为暴乱做准备 何不试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Preparing for a riot… why not try it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好傻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唐娜 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Donna. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说尸体的事了吗 - 什么尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hear about the body? - What body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 什么尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早垃圾清理工在五金店后发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trashmen found it behind the hardware store this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}… eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eaten how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就剩个桃核了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like nothing left but the peach pit, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道是什么东西干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸官说是林子里的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner's saying animals out of the woods…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,山猫什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}bobcats and whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怨不得刚刚丘斯警长那么慌乱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder Sheriff Cuse was so out of sorts back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要去处理这种烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got this whole mess to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一带经常发生这种袭击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attacks like this common for the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住这儿的时候 动物才不会闹这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I lived here, we kept our critters in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下什么踪迹了吗 毛发什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it leave any tracks… you know, any hairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体上连个爪印都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a claw mark on the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞 我给你留位子 乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. Save ya a seat, Jods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 你怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那样呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在希宾警长度假村逍遥快活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having the time of my life at a sheriffs retreat in Hibbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去很棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Sounds like a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Dean says hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.97,0:08:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢告诉我啊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for telling me! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, right. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good. Yeah, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开免提\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put you on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 艾莉克斯怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jody. How's Alex holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 已经当上拉拉队长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Already head of the cheerleading squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢 萨姆 她躲在看台下抽大麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sam, she smokes grass under the bleachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少她没引诱男人去受死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at least she's not luring men to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 这或许不是你们查的那种案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, this may not be your kind of thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今早这里发现了一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a body was found here this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是被严重撕咬过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something had gone to chow town on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,被撕喉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, was the throat ripped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说吃得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hearing that all the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩骨头了 有什么想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been eaten down to the bones. Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不确定 乔迪 我想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I don't know, Jody. I-I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be any trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我自己能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, it's okay. I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我应付不了了 我会打给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I'll call if it gets to be something I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:08:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好好在度假村玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, enjoy the retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 姓温的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还要我继续看这些玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna swallow a bag of knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要吞刀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I got to keep looking at this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去… - 乔迪说她会应付 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's… - Jody said she was on top of it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's take a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是乔迪·米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sheriff Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看今早被送来的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to take a look at the body they brought in this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是希宾警局的人就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as you become a member of the Hibbing police department.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只是不想丢了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just trying to not lose my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.53,0:09:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢利 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Shelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.35,0:09:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些小坏蛋 爱死他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Little jerks. Love them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想来看看被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just came to check out the vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, where's Len at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在度假村忙得不可开交 不难想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's tied up with the retreat. Big surprise, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我心想 住了一酒店的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I figure what's the sense in havi"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不帮帮忙 那还有什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hotel full of sheriffs if you can't help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该有人给你弄个天使的光环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to get you a halo or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um… what's her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔斯警长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sheriff Mills?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把礼貌都落在苏福尔斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might say she left her manners back in Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是跟我一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.59,0:10:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 给我们看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say? Curtains up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐憋住了 场面很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to your breakfasts. This one's grisly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oofta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都吃掉了 这是肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ate the whole kit and caboodle. That's for darn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有卷尺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a measuring tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我看看他的私人物品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see his personal effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小瘦子穿这么肥的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That string bean wore these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰带呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没穿腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't wearing any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大的裤子没腰带能撑住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These stayed up without a belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是被动物偷走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… wild animals stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jodio. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从能拿小来复枪就开始打猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been huntin' since I could hold a mini rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的咬伤都见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen darn near every bite in the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却分辨不出咬伤他的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't tell ya what did the bitin' here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就担心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我也毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Got me stumped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去抽烟 豪伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go smoking, Howie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,看你的《超模》吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch your "Top Model."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏打水还对胃口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that seltzer treatin' ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚的那起动物袭击听上去很严重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That animal attack last night sounded real bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么动物干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of animal you thinkin' did it, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让动物管理局去解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got animal control on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪·米尔斯 苏福尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody Mills, Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Cuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}an issue with the…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽奖的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}raffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下 我得去解决一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I should go see to this. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩 二位警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your night, sheriffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got about as much I.D. as we do… squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让动物管理局去解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let animal control take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,推小车喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Push the cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前跟他玩那个游戏的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to put the cans in his cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想那种人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really missing much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 唐娜 我才认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, Donna, I just met the guy, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但道格看上去像个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doug seems like kind of a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他本来是我家的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go hit the can…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里不会这么反胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… where it's less gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说出去 - 没出什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's keep this to oursel… - Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽奖一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All good with the raffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get real, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你要真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, um, you want real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,又死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… somebody else turned up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来又是动物袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like another animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't spread that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想搅了大家的兴致\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we don't want to spoil everyone's good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者太多人去管事 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or get too many cooks in the kitchen? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和格拉姆警官要去打些电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, uh, deputy Graham and I got to go make a few calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好玩吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and have a good time, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! D…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有鞭炮声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I hear firecrackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hel…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的生活也不那么完美喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, maybe your life's not all cupcakes, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我完美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never said it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,又自己行动了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flyin' the coop without me? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 没事 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No, I get it. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「长点眼色吧 唐娜」 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Take a hint, Donna, " Right? It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,又发生了一起动物袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been another animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the front door. Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚跟丘斯警长谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just talked to Sheriff Cuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on my way out of the morgue,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在估计关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's probably closed by now anyway, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll wait till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can help with there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless you got any gems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么对付一个青春期女孩 我家那位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}on how to handle a teenage girl, 'cause mine is…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺混蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a whole lot more in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错的特质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也17过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 17 once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发指天 脾气老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hair up to here, attitude up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么就无法触动她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I get through to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个年纪时会听劝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let anybody through to you at that age?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔·德莫皮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey DeMoupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drove a motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smelled like…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会想通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不就是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,又死了人 混蛋前任\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, fresh corpse, jerk ex-husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受控的少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}out-of-control teen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一起喝个大醉 看付费电视吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to get blingo'd on my minibar and watch pay-per-view?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天好累\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我能应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你也好高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去停尸房 你们来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm headed to the morgue. You want in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们刚从那儿过来 - 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, we just came from there. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二位死者的肉也都被吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And flesh was eaten off the second vic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,少什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.34,0:18:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的钱包 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wallet. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得第一个孩子的腰带丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think a belt was missing off the first kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A belt? So…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 怪物先吃后抢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what? We have monsters eating and then robbing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 你加糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jodio, you take sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okeydokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:18:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jodio"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是唐娜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that, uh, uh, Donna?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 减肥水疗那个 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fat-spa Donna. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识我的跟踪狂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys know my stalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她上次差点搞砸我们的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She nearly blew a case for us last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 自从我到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I haven't been able to shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直摆脱不掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ray of sunshine since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还挺能帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's actually been pretty helpful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是想让她不发现这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, you know, it's just tough keeping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,破事实在不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of this nightmare stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你能牵制住她 让我们四处打探一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. You mind distracting her while we poke around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一跑来 我就变保姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show up, and now I'm a babysitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在还没掺和进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, she hasn't gotten mixed up with this crap yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们努力别让她知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just try to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她要给我看她的贴纸收藏 我就不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she tries to show me her sticker collection, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利探员 克里斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Frehley? Agent Criss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汉斯姆警长 - 我就觉得是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sheriff Hanscum. - I thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 你们怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't this a kick in the pants? What dragged you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能多说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, uh… we can't talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah. I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.43,0:19:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么要我帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no, no. Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 警长 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, sheriff, I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们是不是去看看装备展览\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I could go check out the gear expo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那停尸房呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the morgue?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, like you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物管理局解决那事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}animal control will handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不介意我就不介意 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, if it's cool with you, it's cool with me. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过听说展品可很厉害呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did hear they're packing some pretty serious heat in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 克里斯和菲利探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there. Agents Criss and Frehley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,希宾的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of…Hibbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're here investigating the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几晚的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the last couple nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你进展如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wondering where you're at on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物袭击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the, uh… animal attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们联调局没别的可做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You telling me the FBI has got nothing better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是听命令而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we go where the boss tells us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来做什么 逮捕希宾的山猫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what… arrest a bobcat from Hibbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是第一个空手离开的联调局探员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't the first feds to roll through here and come up with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.28,0:20:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过看你们努力很好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is cute to watch you try, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 联调局才不做「好玩」的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pal, the FBI doesn't do cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘斯警长 我们只是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Sheriff Cuse, we are just hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.20,0:21:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有监控拍下了袭击事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}there might be some surveillance footage of the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许交通摄像头什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a traffic camera caught something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可惜 没有任何记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. No. Sorry, I-I-I don't have a record of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.31,0:21:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能替我照顾着展览的事吗 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you keep an eye on the expo for me, uh, deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去动物管理局问问进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to check in with the guys at animal control.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位探员 认识你们很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents, good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己拿点熊爪吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…help yourself to a bear claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长在撒谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋警官似乎是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deputy douche seems to think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去试试破解警方服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll go try and crack the police server.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许监控拍到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something showed up on surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我去试试那个警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe I'll go crack the deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但这次是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, but this time, try to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对你的幌子工作那么有保护欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little less defensive of your "pretend job."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个局徽是有意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this badge means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在印刷店做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it at kinko's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到骄傲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be proud of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官女士 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, officer ladies, check this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以带去吃饭 去健身馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take it to lunch, to the gym,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做美甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}have your nails done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会一直陪着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's always by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大你没问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can handle a big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,西格玛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sigma, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.39,0:22:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,10磅拉力 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 pounds pull weight. Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就算大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call this a big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你开的是保时捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you drive a porsche.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,查兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.63,0:22:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想唬这姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're trying to pull the wool over this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.24,0:22:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯姆警长是披着羊皮的猛狼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Hanscum here is a wolf in sheepskin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.91,0:22:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼的确很威猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolves are majestic creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的甜言蜜语留着给其他女人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But save your flattery for other female people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,古德希尔警长啊 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sheriff Goodhill. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们才认识嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, we just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铐友嘛 你懂的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cufflinks… you know how it is. - Cuff what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,铐友 是一个警察的约会网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cufflinks! It's a dating site for cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上那个网站吗 唐娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You on it, Donna?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没到那个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.99,0:23:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在减肥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you still, uh, getting in date shape, huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想先把我录的片子都看完\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get through the stuff on my dvr first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for the love of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么毛病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就靠说女孩胖找自尊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get off on fat-shaming chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你一点不胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so not fat, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just a douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.29,0:23:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干什么 乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the h-e-double hockey sticks, Jody?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.18,0:23:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当面说我前夫是混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling my ex a douche to his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正看上去你也不打算这么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't look like you were gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么意思 我们都离婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would be the point? We're divorced!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我现在还能改变他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm gonna change him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.83,0:23:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就永远可以欺负你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he gets to treat you like a doormat forever? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.70,0:23:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你也失去了丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till you've actually lost a husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.12,0:23:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别来管我家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep your mouth zipped about mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.83,0:24:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丈夫出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did something happen… to your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有各自的烦恼 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our crosses to bear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.03,0:24:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我说错话很抱歉 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I'm sorry if I… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.33,0:24:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很公平 是我先说了过分的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fair. I certainly went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk about it or…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.39,0:24:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.40,0:24:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.57,0:24:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去喘口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.87,0:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来找小手铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking for some teeny-weeny handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给动物爪子戴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to slap on some paws?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们有点误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we got off on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.63,0:25:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.52,0:25:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我搭档来这里进行的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this investigation that my partner and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是件大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}are here on, it's… it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要本地警方的协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, we're looking for some local help…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.32,0:25:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, someone who's not…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.74,0:25:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢跟华盛顿大人物打交道的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not afraid to talk shop with the big boys back in D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.57,0:25:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这有兴趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that might be something you'd be interested in?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.87,0:25:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.79,0:25:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做点什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.25,0:25:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我需要你对我完全坦诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first of all, I'm gonna need you to be totally straight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.93,0:25:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何关于袭击的录像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any footage of the attack …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.81,0:25:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天丘斯警长改了服务器的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Cuse changed the password on the server yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有现场录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got the live feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是第一起袭击现场街对面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the traffic camera across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通摄像头拍摄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from where that first vic got attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查看那个录像时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went to go check the footage,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.21,0:25:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长说他自己来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}sheriff said he'd do it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.15,0:25:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有说原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得知道 警长是个正直的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, sheriff's a-a straight shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.95,0:26:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定有自己的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he had his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.34,0:26:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 很感谢你的合作 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I appreciate the cooperation, deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的时候会来找你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, when I need you, I'll come find you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.97,0:26:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁「动物袭击」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal attack, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.13,0:27:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见丘斯警长了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen sheriff Cuse around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,展览之后就没看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since the Expo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.84,0:27:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.65,0:27:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样啊 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.83,0:27:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.33,0:27:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒啊 为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.94,0:27:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,传言说你几个月前出了点状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word 'round the campfire is you went off the res a couple months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.65,0:27:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆一直在偷偷互通消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sam been passing notes during class?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.85,0:27:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing I can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.83,0:27:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么随口一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.96,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你想谈谈 我随时奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make a mean bowl of chowder if you ever need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.82,0:28:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.47,0:28:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到什么线索了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.32,0:28:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经有线索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, there was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.53,0:28:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我黑进了监控服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hacked into the surveillance server,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.19,0:28:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是文件已经被删除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the files had been deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.05,0:28:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说丘斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said that sheriff Cuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.17,0:28:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是唯一能接触到那些文件的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the only one who had access to those files.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔迪 我们能谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody, can we talk a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.21,0:28:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.47,0:28:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们到处转转去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll go … we'll go look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.29,0:28:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 首先 我之前不应该插手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, back there, I was wrong to butt in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我伤害了你 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it hurt you, and I'm … I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.65,0:28:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.65,0:28:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了 「别甘受欺负」 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah."Quit being a doormat." Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 乔迪 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear ya, Jody. It's okay. We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…有些别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only… there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't quite wrap my head around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有想过世上有一些东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think there are things out there …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不曾被警察记录在案的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't end up on the police blotter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.57,0:28:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能详细说说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give me some specifics?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.14,0:28:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.87,0:28:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时离得比较远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was … I was kinda far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.11,0:29:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以可能是我看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe I didn't see it right,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我觉得我看见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what I think I saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.03,0:29:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}were teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是丘斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sheriff Cuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见他站在古德希尔警长的尸体旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him standing over sheriff Goodhill's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他的嘴里满是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his mouth was full of…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖利的牙齿 就像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}shark teeth, like some kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.78,0:29:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.15,0:29:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.44,0:29:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.07,0:29:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.31,0:29:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躲起来了 像个傻子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid … like a chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.39,0:29:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.99,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那俩联调局的人也会相信你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So will those guys from the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.65,0:29:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 我看见丘斯把他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I saw Cuse taking his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.52,0:29:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿进了跟我隔了几间的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a room down the hall from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,304号\N{\fnArial\fs30}304.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是菲利探员 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Agent Frehley. Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 丘斯就是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Cuse is our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐娜说看到他进了304号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna said she saw him check in to 304.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.28,0:29:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给本地警方处理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let the locals handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.17,0:30:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, trust me…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事绝不能让本地警方处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}The locals should not handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.72,0:30:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些防晒霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all this sunblock.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.61,0:30:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他是在科帕卡巴纳海滩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think he's at the Copacabana or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.93,0:30:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头再解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.98,0:31:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那玩意干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.24,0:31:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到你的语音留言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.89,0:31:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她突然就抽出把刀 - 丘斯警长是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She just pulled out a machete. - Sheriff Cuse is a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.08,0:31:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐娜看到了他的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donna saw his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼 吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the cuss?! A vampire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要跟她解释下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to give her the talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.84,0:31:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We good?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.77,0:31:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那之前在减肥水疗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So, when we were at the weight-loss spa …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.62,0:31:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸走了你的脂肪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking on your fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.11,0:31:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们解决好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.71,0:31:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.57,0:31:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道那么快减去10磅太不现实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew losing 10 pounds that fast was too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.83,0:31:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能警长…吸血鬼就是去了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is where sheriff…vampire went.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.19,0:32:03.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（424 跛子溪路）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.44,0:32:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好猜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.53,0:32:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.27,0:32:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是镇外的一座旧农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's an old farm outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.36,0:32:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.64,0:32:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们仅有的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the only lead we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.02,0:32:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect, sheriff, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但吸血鬼可比你扔进监狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}vampires are far more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.89,0:32:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些泛泛之辈要危险得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the johns you throw in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.17,0:32:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能插手这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.97,0:32:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff you, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.44,0:32:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你真名叫啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or whatever your real name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.94,0:32:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯姆没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanscum's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔迪 - 我说了她没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jody… - I said she's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.83,0:32:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那行 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. But,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.78,0:32:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're staying back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.19,0:32:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带头 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking the lead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.31,0:33:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要挥就得使劲挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna swing, swing hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付吸血鬼 得把头砍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}With vamps, head's gotta roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.85,0:34:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.70,0:34:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 向日葵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hi, there, sunflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.07,0:35:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是爱 小帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all love, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.74,0:35:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都将融入我们体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you will become all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.19,0:35:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一点都不会浪费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't waste one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.22,0:35:13.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,得了木法沙（出自电影《狮子王》） 少来生命循环的那一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mufasa, enough with the "{\u1}Circle of life{\u0}" Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.03,0:35:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.41,0:35:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个败类 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scum. End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.62,0:35:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们杀人还不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … it's not enough that you kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.19,0:35:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要抢人家的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to rob them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.02,0:35:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫搜刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We scavenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是喝两口就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't sip and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.92,0:35:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会物尽其用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use every part of the buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然还给过你午饭钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to think I gave you lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.87,0:35:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你正好赶上晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you came in time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔尔 拜托 放他们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starr, please, let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经帮了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.53,0:35:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把鲶鱼杀那男人的监控录像删了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I ditched that video o-of catfish killing that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.91,0:35:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要帮忙 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't want favors, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.49,0:35:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能有什么用 我连人都不杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What use am I now? I don't even kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.67,0:35:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只喝袋装血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm on bagged blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.32,0:35:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.77,0:36:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到你露着吸血鬼的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you with your vampire face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.14,0:36:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在古德希尔警长尸体边\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing over sheriff Goodhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我发现了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I-I-I found her. I …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.67,0:36:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到了她的血的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I s-smelled her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不住我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I couldn't help my …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.54,0:36:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我没有咬她 - 还真是个大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I didn't bite. - Well, aren't you a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.47,0:36:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃人是你的天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your nature to eat people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.41,0:36:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吸血的吸血鬼就像是 就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vampire who doesn't feed is like a … like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃素的老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger eating salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.00,0:36:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会停手的 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna stop, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.36,0:36:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会干掉你可爱的希宾镇上所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take down every person in your sweet, little Hibbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.44,0:36:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你回到我们中间来\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you come back to the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.64,0:36:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd you do, Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.56,0:36:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了他们的「火人节」狂欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, break up Burning man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.53,0:37:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍德斯托克狂欢更贴切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like Woodstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.70,0:37:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸把我赶出了家门 是伦在路边发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len found me crying on the curb after my daddy kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.01,0:37:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上了伦的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got in Len's van,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.69,0:37:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 就是「血池肉林」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rest is wavy gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.85,0:37:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么伦就是你的杀人导师了 就像查理·曼森（邪教组织的领袖）\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … Len's like your Charlie Manson?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.64,0:37:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理才比不上伦呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie couldn't hold a candle to Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.52,0:37:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把一切都教给了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught us everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.11,0:37:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定都是些神神叨叨的东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure it was all kombucha and kumbaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.28,0:37:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教会了我们释放天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberating is what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果有一天 伦突然不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one day, poof! Len's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.62,0:37:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他的照片出现在了报纸上 太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till he landed his photo in the paper. Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.29,0:37:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开了一家警察度假村\N{\fnArial\fs30}For running a police retreat, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不仅改过自新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't just go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.34,0:37:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然还成了一个该死的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You became a damn cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.37,0:37:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太过了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that is wild, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.11,0:37:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感受到野性了吗 伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you feeling dirty, Len?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.78,0:37:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上要大开杀戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're about to have ourselves a bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.83,0:37:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想知道我为什么离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to know why I left?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.86,0:38:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.27,0:38:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有了良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.88,0:38:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎物祈求我们饶他们一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prey that begged for their lives …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.41,0:38:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使像我教你们的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it was like even if I used every part,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.25,0:38:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不浪费一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I taught you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样也还是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's still wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.48,0:38:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想保护人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to protect people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.58,0:38:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我残食了他们那么多年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After so many years of…gutting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.98,0:38:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入你们的吸血大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll join your bloody caravan…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.80,0:38:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你们不杀了这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it means you won't kill these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.80,0:38:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会杀任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aren't killing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.76,0:39:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.66,0:39:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.06,0:39:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经不认识你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't know who you are anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.75,0:39:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说我们没努力过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't say we didn't try.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.46,0:40:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下逍遥了 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hakuna matata, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.71,0:40:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.35,0:40:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.66,0:40:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是有点想吐 除此之外很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than feeling like I want to hurl, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.64,0:40:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚 砍下了 一个吸血鬼的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…chopped off… A vampire's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.65,0:40:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很厉害呢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were great at that. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.86,0:40:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.17,0:40:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.89,0:40:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我回来以后第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, for the first time I've been back,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.02,0:40:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没感觉受到血印的驱使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't feel like the mark was pushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.95,0:40:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.15,0:40:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道有这些东西的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing that these things are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.67,0:40:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界看起来 我说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes the world seem … I don't know …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.95,0:40:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.14,0:40:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,更黑暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.95,0:40:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚杀掉那些吸血鬼时 我感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, back there, killing those vamps…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,又变回自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.30,0:41:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.74,0:41:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.19,0:41:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想了解怎么对付这些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you want any pointers on how to fight this crazy crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.63,0:41:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意给你讲讲 他们的克星什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to fill you in … you know, what kills what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.99,0:41:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.24,0:41:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.48,0:41:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go with that.
